{"id":"processus","lemma":"processus","pos":"noun","rank":2278,"glosses":["process"],"ipa":"/pʁɔ.sɛ.sys/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6e/Fr-processus.ogg/Fr-processus.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","examples":[{"text":"Le processus peut prendre des années.","en":"The process can take years.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"year","l":"année"}]},{"text":"C'est un processus très simple.","en":"It's a very simple process.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"very"},{"g":"simple"}]},{"text":"Le processus est en cours.","en":"It's an ongoing process.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"in progress"]]},{"text":"Je lui ai expliqué le processus.","en":"I explained the process to him.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to explain","l":"expliquer"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Le processus ne peut être inversé.","en":"The process can't be reversed.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"inverted"}]}]}